                  <additions>
                     <list>
                        <item xml:id="a1">
                           <locus target="#172rb"/>
                           <desc type="DonationNote">Donation note, written in <ref target="#h1">Hand 1</ref>. The names of donor and the scribe have been erased. Only a part of the donor’s name, Fāsiladas, has been retained.</desc>
                           <q xml:lang="gez">ዝዝማሬ፡ <del rend="erasure"/> ተ፡ ፋሲለደስ፡ ወጽሐፊሁ፡ <del rend="erasure"/>፡ ዘሰረቆ፡ <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="MK"/></q>
                           <quote xml:lang="en"/>
                        </item>
                        <item xml:id="a2">
                           <locus target="#172rc"/>
                           <desc type="DonationNote">Donation note, written in a well-trained secondary hand. The names of the
                              church that owned it and the commissioner have been erased. The name of the church should be read ‘Qǝddus Giyorgis’. 
                              It states that the manuscript was written during the office of a certain Fāsiladas.</desc>
                           <q xml:lang="gez">ዝዝማሬ፡ [ዘቅዱስ፡ ጊዮርጊስ]፡ ዘተጽሕፈ፡ በሢመተ፡ ፋሲለደስ፡ ዘአጽሐፎ፡ በንዋዩ፡ <del rend="erasure"/> ከመ፡ ይኩኖ፡ <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="MK"/></q>
                           </item>
                        <item xml:id="a3">
                           <locus target="#172va"/>
                           <desc type="GuestText">Excerpt from <ref type="work" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT2610Zemmar">ʾAkkotetu za-Yohannǝs</ref>, which was most likely forgotten to be introduced in the main text. 
                              <bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/L5GXR7WR"><seg type="book"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:Zemmaremawaset1994"/><title level="m">ዝማሬ ወመዋሥዕት። &lt;hi rend="italics"&gt;(Zǝmmāre wa-mawāśǝʾt)&lt;/hi&gt;</title><pubPlace>n.p. [ʾAddis ʾAbabā]</pubPlace><publisher>Tənśāʾe māssātamiya dərəǧǧət</publisher><date>1994</date><citedRange unit="page">146c</citedRange></bibl></desc>
                              <q xml:lang="gez">ዘአኰቴቶ ዝማሬ፡ ዘተረስዖ፡ ሶበሰ፡ አእመረ፡ ሰይጣን፡ በመስቀሉ፡ ለወልዱ፡ <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="MK"/></q>
                        </item>
                        
