                              <placeName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/INS0105DD">ʾAbuna ʾAragāwi</placeName> is likely written over an erased name of the church <placeName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/INS0101MadhaneAlam">Madḫāne ʿĀlam</placeName>.</desc>
